{"seq":5,"slug":"integrated-circuits","title":"集成电路科学与工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"集成电路科学与工程-简介\">集成电路科学与工程 简介</h1><p>集成电路科学与工程是 2020 年正式设立的一级学科，涵盖从半导体物理到芯片系统集成的完整知识体系。本学科以微电子学和计算机科学为基础，融合材料、物理、化学、自动化等多学科交叉知识，培养具备芯片设计、制造、封测及 EDA 工具开发能力的高层次人才。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向集成电路专业本科高年级及研究生阶段学生，同时适合从事芯片设计、半导体制造、EDA 开发的工程师作为系统性参考资料。</p>\n<p>全部内容分为四个章节，沿着&quot;器件—电路—工艺—工具&quot;的主线展开：</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>半导体基础</strong>从能带理论与载流子输运出发，深入讲解 MOSFET 等核心器件的工作原理与建模方法，为电路设计提供物理基础。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>电路设计</strong>覆盖模拟 IC、数字 IC 和 SoC 三大方向，从运算放大器设计到片上系统架构，建立从单元电路到复杂系统的设计能力。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>制造与封装</strong>聚焦集成电路制造全流程，包括先进光刻工艺、纳米节点技术演进，以及 Chiplet 等新型封装技术，帮助理解设计与工艺的协同约束。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>EDA 与验证</strong>介绍电子设计自动化工具链和验证方法学，涵盖综合布局布线、功能验证、可制造性设计等关键环节，是连接设计意图与物理实现的桥梁。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：先掌握半导体物理基础，再进入电路设计（可根据兴趣选择模拟或数字方向），之后学习制造工艺以理解设计规则的物理来源，最后学习 EDA 与验证将各环节贯通。有志于全栈芯片工程师的读者可按顺序完整学习；侧重某一方向的读者可在完成第1章后直接进入感兴趣的章节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"semiconductor-fundamentals","title":"半导体基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/semiconductor-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"semiconductor-physics","title":"半导体物理学：能带理论与载流子输运","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/semiconductor-fundamentals/semiconductor-physics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transistor-devices","title":"晶体管器件原理：从平面 MOSFET 到环栅晶体管","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/semiconductor-fundamentals/transistor-devices"},{"seq":3,"slug":"device-modeling","title":"器件建模与仿真：从物理方程到电路级紧凑模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/semiconductor-fundamentals/device-modeling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"circuit-design","title":"电路设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/circuit-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analog-ic-design","title":"模拟集成电路设计：从运算放大器到数据转换器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/circuit-design/analog-ic-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-ic-design","title":"数字集成电路设计：从逻辑综合到时序收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/circuit-design/digital-ic-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"soc-architecture","title":"SoC 架构设计：总线互联、IP 复用与异构计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/circuit-design/soc-architecture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"fabrication-and-packaging","title":"制造与封装","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/fabrication-and-packaging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ic-fabrication-process","title":"集成电路制造工艺：从硅片到芯片的微纳加工","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/fabrication-and-packaging/ic-fabrication-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-process-nodes","title":"先进工艺节点：从 FinFET 到 GAA 的晶体管革命","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/fabrication-and-packaging/advanced-process-nodes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"packaging-technology","title":"封装与测试技术：Chiplet 时代的三维集成","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/fabrication-and-packaging/packaging-technology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"eda-and-verification","title":"EDA 与验证","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/eda-and-verification","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eda-tools-ecosystem","title":"EDA 工具生态：芯片设计的数字基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/eda-and-verification/eda-tools-ecosystem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"functional-verification","title":"功能验证方法学：确保十亿门芯片的设计正确性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/eda-and-verification/functional-verification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-for-manufacturing","title":"可制造性设计：让设计意图在硅片上忠实实现","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/integrated-circuits/eda-and-verification/design-for-manufacturing"}]}]}